        "product_summary": "Textile upper with moulded overlays: Open knit zones combine with shaped quarter and heel panels for a layered casual sneaker profile.\n\nCord lacing: The front cord crosses through the eyelet panel, with toggle hardware shown in the actual close-up.\n\nSculpted rubber outsole: Diagonal ribs along the sidewall and the separate underside pattern are shown in original photographs.\n\nRear entry details: A pull loop, raised heel panel and contrast colour insert define the back of the shoe.\n\nTwo colour options: Sand and Black are listed in EU38-44 for wholesale colour-size assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
